# 0012-home-close-keydown-reopen.patch
# Fix: closing a Home window reopened the just-closed app (close→reopen loop).
#  Primary fix: openTarget() now clears the desktop icon selection on launch, so a
#  stray Enter/Space can no longer relaunch a closed window (the desktop keydown
#  handlers only fire while shellState.selectedDesktopTargetId is set). The close
#  button additionally stops click propagation (belt-and-suspenders).
# Kill condition: drop if upstream Home clears desktop selection on launch itself.
